---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
import SectionTitle from "../components/SectionTitle.astro";
---

<BaseLayout title="About | InChief Printing">

<section class="container-industrial py-24">
  <SectionTitle title="About Company" />

  <p class="text-neutral-400 max-w-3xl">
    InChief Printing is an integrated high-tech printing and packaging manufacturer established in 2020 in Longgang City, Zhejiang Province, through the strategic alliance of four leading industrial enterprises with strong governmental support.
  </p>
  <p class="text-neutral-400 max-w-3xl">
    With a registered capital of RMB 108 million and a modern production campus covering 78,000 square meters, the company provides comprehensive solutions covering packaging design, engineering development, manufacturing, and supply chain services. InChief specializes in corrugated cartons, premium packaging boxes, food and pharmaceutical packaging, gift packaging, hardcover publications, commercial prints, and labeling products.
  </p>
  <p class="text-neutral-400 max-w-3xl">
    Guided by the philosophy of precision manufacturing and long-term partnership, InChief focuses on delivering optimized cost efficiency, stable production capability, and integrated end-to-end services for global customers.
  </p>
</section>

<section class="container-industrial py-24">
  <SectionTitle title="Factory Strength" />
  <p class="text-neutral-400 max-w-3xl">
    InChief Printing operates an intelligent manufacturing facility built for large-scale industrial production and high-efficiency workflow integration.
  </p>
  
  <p class="text-neutral-400 max-w-3xl">
    The factory is equipped with world-class printing systems including Koenig & Bauer and Heidelberg multi-color offset presses, supported by Kodak CTP plate-making technology, automated lamination, hot stamping, die-cutting, inspection, and high-speed folding-gluing production lines. An integrated ESKO digital prepress workflow enables intelligent layout processing, 3D visualization, and unified color management from design to mass production.
  </p>

  <p class="text-neutral-400 max-w-3xl">
    Automated logistics systems, AGV transportation, and standardized production management ensure stable quality, rapid response capability, and reliable delivery performance. Dedicated manufacturing centers focus on premium corrugated packaging, food & pharmaceutical packaging, and luxury gift packaging, enabling flexible production for diverse industrial applications.
  </p>
</section>

<section class="container-industrial py-24">
  <SectionTitle title="Development History" />

  <p class="text-neutral-400 max-w-3xl">
    Continuous innovation in industrial print manufacturing and packaging engineering.
  </p>
</section>

</BaseLayout>